      data:
        _guid: 75ec7db76a0b4722be20f023c325226f
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A summoner (necromancer, hive mother, drone controller — any faction): it raises minions whenever it can (EnemyData › Kit › Summon, e.g. Raise the Dead), keeps its distance behind cover, backs off when anything gets close, and otherwise strikes from hiding (Peekaboo).'
